<title>POLAND: Mostostal E shares to trade in Vienna.</title>
<headline>Mostostal E shares to trade in Vienna.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA plans for some its shares to trade on the parallel floor of the Vienna Stock Exchange, the company said in a statement on Friday, giving no other details.</p>
<p>Mostostal currently has American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) trading on the Berlin and Frankfurt bourses.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
